# Marketing review notes

**Source:** `marketing/launch-copy.md`  
**Against:** `product/spec.md` (modified 2026-09-11T01:53:38-04:00)

---

| Claim in launch copy | Spec says | Conflict |
|---|---|---|
| "Works offline, anywhere." | "Offline support: removed in this release." | Offline support was explicitly removed in this release. The copy claims it exists. |
| "Export to … PDF" | "Export: CSV only." | PDF export is not supported — only CSV is listed. |
| "Export to … Excel" | "Export: CSV only." | Excel export is not supported — only CSV is listed. |
| "Export to … in one click" | "Export: CSV only." | Implies a multi-format export feature; only single-format CSV export is specified. |

## Summary

**3 unsupported claims.** The copy describes offline support that was removed, and two export formats (PDF, Excel) the spec does not include. The "one click" phrasing is misleading for what exists.

## Previous review

This is the first review of this revision.
